From: Mahdi Arts <mahdi-arts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: 2026-08-21
Subject: [PATCH] ci: activate hardened CI & release workflows (SHA-pinned, supply-chain gates)

Applies the hardened .github/workflows/ci.yml and release.yml
(blocking audits/tests/smoke, SHA-pinned actions, AUR fail-closed, optional
GPG SHA256SUMS.sig; SHA256SUMS + per-artifact SPDX SBOM + SLSA provenance).
Apply with:  git am docs/patches/hardened-ci-workflows.patch
Pushing workflow files needs a token with the 'workflows' scope
(a classic PAT or a direct push from a maintainer machine).

